    "http://careers.utah.edu/employers": {
      "title": "U Career Success",
      "description": "Recruiters & Employers – U Career Success Skip to content U CAREER SUCCESS MENU Students Career Coaches Internships+ Events International Student Resources Career Courses Resources and Tools Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Starting an Internship Program Next-Level Engagement Career Fair Recruiting Campus Partners Campus Partners Home Workshops Co-Sponsor an Event U Career Success Leadership More Career Impact Awards Contact Us Search Site Powered by the University of Utah Powered by Search Campus U Career Success Career Coaches Recruiters & Employers Campus Partners Events Home Recruiters & Employers Hire Top Talent Let's Work Together Our Corporate & Community Engagement team is excited to work with you! Each member of our team works with a specific group of industries. Reach out to the person whose industries are the closest match for your organization. If you're not sure who to reach out to, or if your industry isn't listed, contact our team at [email protected] and we'll match you with a dedicated relationship manager. Read our U of U recruiting policies. Meet Your Relationship Manager Engage With Your Future Talent Pool Post a Job or Internship Get your job or internship listing in front of thousands of qualified students and alumni. LEARN MORE Start an Internship Program Bring in fresh perspectives and create a pipeline for new hires while getting extra work done. LEARN MORE Attend Fairs & Expos Connect with a remarkable talent pool, build your brand on campus, and recruit students at our career events. SEE EVENT LIST Next-Level Engagement Expand your presence on campus with tabling, info sessions, student organization connections, sponsorship and more! LEARN MORE Meet The Team Denise DeCoite Senior Director, U Career Success Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1630 Debora Owens Senior Associate Director, Corporate & Community Engagement Industry: Consulting Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1633 Jane Dower