    "https://careers.utah.edu/employers/": {
      "title": "U Career Success",
      "description": "Recruiters & Employers – U Career Success Skip to content U CAREER SUCCESS MENU Students Career Coaches Internships+ Events International Student Resources Career Courses Resources and Tools Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Starting an Internship Program Next-Level Engagement Career Fair Recruiting Campus Partners Campus Partners Home Workshops Co-Sponsor an Event U Career Success Leadership More Career Impact Awards Contact Us Search Site Powered by the University of Utah Powered by Search Campus U Career Success Career Coaches Recruiters & Employers Campus Partners Events Home Recruiters & Employers Hire Top Talent Let's Work Together Our Corporate & Community Engagement team is excited to work with you! Each member of our team works with a specific group of industries. Reach out to the person whose industries are the closest match for your organization. If you're not sure who to reach out to, or if your industry isn't listed, contact our team at [email protected] and we'll match you with a dedicated relationship manager. Read our U of U recruiting policies. Meet Your Relationship Manager Engage With Your Future Talent Pool Post a Job or Internship Get your job or internship listing in front of thousands of qualified students and alumni. LEARN MORE Start an Internship Program Bring in fresh perspectives and create a pipeline for new hires while getting extra work done. LEARN MORE Attend Fairs & Expos Connect with a remarkable talent pool, build your brand on campus, and recruit students at our career events. SEE EVENT LIST Next-Level Engagement Expand your presence on campus with tabling, info sessions, student organization connections, sponsorship and more! LEARN MORE Meet The Team Denise DeCoite Senior Director, U Career Success Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1630 Debora Owens Senior Associate Director, Corporate & Community Engagement Industry: Consulting Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1633 Jane Dower Event Manager Industry: Accounting Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-2266 Robin Shapiro Relationship Manager Industry: Consumer, Manufacturing, & Transportation Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1649 Amy Whittaker Relationship Manager Industry: Public Service, Community, & Social Impact Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 646-8043 Tara Elggren Relationship Manager Industries: Marketing, Media, Sports, & Outdoor Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-2214 Christy Wagner Relationship Manager Industry: Technology Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 585-5036 Heather Hans Relationship Manager Industry: Engineering, Energy & Defense Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1648 Darren Wesemann Crimson Projects Director Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 808-7200 Leslie Bolton Relationship Manager Industry: Healthcare, Nursing, Science, & Life Sciences Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 581-4473 Lisa Lovoi Relationship Manager Industries: Arts, Entertainment, & Design Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 216-1622 Mandi Newsome Relationship Manager Industries: Finance/Fintech Email: [email protected] Phone: (801) 213-1610 Let's Connect Follow us on LinkedIn for recruiting event updates and reminders, tips for finding success at fairs and expos, and strategies for recruiting U students. Follow Us Thanks to Our Sponsors Sponsors enjoy added visibility and branding on campus, as well as priority table placement at career fairs and other recruiting events. If you are interested in sponsorship opportunities, please contact Denise DeCoite. Students Log in to Handshake Events Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Next-Level Engagement Career Fairs & Expos Recruiting Policies U Career Success 1731 E Campus Center Dr, STE 1300 SALT LAKE CITY, UT 84112 801-587-8687 Top Resources International Student Resources Other Campus Partners Contact Us © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF UTAH Nondiscrimination & Accessibility Disclaimer Privacy About the U Media Contacts"
