      "description": "Recruit at Career Fairs – U Career Success Skip to content U CAREER SUCCESS MENU Students Career Coaches Internships+ Events International Student Resources Career Courses Resources and Tools Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Starting an Internship Program Next-Level Engagement Career Fair Recruiting Campus Partners Campus Partners Home Workshops Co-Sponsor an Event U Career Success Leadership More Career Impact Awards Contact Us Search Site Powered by the University of Utah Powered by Search Campus U Career Success Career Coaches Recruiters & Employers Campus Partners Events Home Recruiters & Employers Recruit at Career Fairs Recruit at Networking and Hiring Events Upcoming Career Fairs and Expos Finance, Fintech, & Accounting Career Expo September 10, 2026 | 4 pm - 6 pm Garff Building, Kahlert Hall REGISTER NOW Business Career Expo September 17, 2026 | 4 pm - 6 pm Child Hall REGISTRATION FULL STEM Internship & Career Fair September 22, 2026 | 9 am - 3 pm A. Ray Olpin Student Union REGISTER NOW Pathways Computing Career Expo September 24, 2026 | 10 am - 2 pm Alumni House REGISTER NOW Civil & Construction Engineering Career Expo September 29, 2026 | 9 am - 1 pm A. Ray Olpin Student Union REGISTER NOW Associated General Contractors Networking Mixer October 1, 2026 | 11 am - 1 pm Catmull Gallery REGISTER NOW Internship & Career Fair October 6, 2026 | 9 am - 2 pm A. Ray Olpin Student Union REGISTER NOW Meet the TEKs October 8, 2026 | 4 pm - 6 pm Child Hall REGISTER NOW QAMO Networking Night October 20, 2026 | 4 pm - 6 pm Child Hall REGISTER NOW Marketing & Communication Career Expo October 28, 2026 | 10 am - 1 pm Robert H. and Katharine B. Garff Building, Kahlert Hall, 4th Floor REGISTER NOW Work With Us Our Corporate & Community Engagement team is excited to work with you! Each member of our team works with a specific group of industries. Reach out to the person whose industries are the closest match for your organization. If you're not sure who to reach out to, or if your industry isn't listed, contact our team at [email protected] and we'll match you with a dedicated relationship manager. Read our U of U recruiting policies. Meet Your Relationship Manager Get Results from Career Fairs and Expos Build Student Interest Take additional steps to build student interest in your company and opportunities. Post your current internship and employment opportunities in Handshake . Contact the Corporate & Community Engagement Team for support and collaboration Communicate with Students Get the word out! Post about your attendance at the upcoming fair or expo on social media. Message students directly through Handshake. Read this Handshake article to learn how . Additional Support Molly Coughlin Director, Events & Operations [email protected] (801) 585-9205 Molly Coughlin Director, Events & Operations For event questions, reach out to Molly Coughlin . For additional recruiting support, contact a member of the Corporate & Community Engagement team. Students Log in to Handshake Events Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Next-Level Engagement Career Fairs & Expos Recruiting Policies U Career Success 1731 E Campus Center Dr, STE 1300 SALT LAKE CITY, UT 84112 801-587-8687 Top Resources International Student Resources Other Campus Partners Contact Us © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF UTAH Nondiscrimination & Accessibility Disclaimer Privacy About the U Media Contacts"
