    "https://careers.utah.edu": {
      "title": "U Career Success",
      "description": "U Career Success Skip to content U CAREER SUCCESS MENU Students Career Coaches Internships+ Events International Student Resources Career Courses Resources and Tools Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Starting an Internship Program Next-Level Engagement Career Fair Recruiting Campus Partners Campus Partners Home Workshops Co-Sponsor an Event U Career Success Leadership More Career Impact Awards Contact Us Search Site Powered by the University of Utah Powered by Search Campus U Career Success Career Coaches Recruiters & Employers Campus Partners Events Attend Career Fairs and Expos See Event List Students Meet With Your Career Coach Employers Hire Top Talent Campus Partners Work With Us Headshots Get a free professional photo to use for your LinkedIn profile. Schedule A Photo Video Studio Use our sound-controlled private rooms for video interviews. Book A Studio Career Closet Borrow professional clothing for job interviews, career fairs, and more. Borrow Free Clothes Meet Your Career Coach Our career coaches specialize in working with specific majors and industries and offer personalized guidance. They can help you build your resume, prepare for networking events and job interviews, and more. Schedule A Meeting Peer Coach Resume Review Submit your resume to get feedback from a peer coach. Submit Your Resume Handshake Handshake is the go-to spot for job listings, career event registration, and other helpful career resources. Login To Handshake Events View all Sep 07 Monday Labor Day Sep 09 Wednesday 4pm - 6pm Meet the Professionals l Careers in Public Accounting, Audit & Tax Eccles Business Building - Spencer Fox  (SFEBB) Sep 10 Thursday 4pm - 6pm Finance, Fintech, & Accounting Career Expo Eccles Business Building - Spencer Fox  (SFEBB) Sep 17 Thursday 4pm - 6pm Business Career Expo Eccles Business Building - Spencer Fox  (SFEBB) Sep 22 Tuesday 9am - 3pm STEM Internship & Career Fair Union - A. Ray Olpin (UNION) See All Events Social Media Feed Students Log in to Handshake Events Employers Employers Home Post a Job or Internship Next-Level Engagement Career Fairs & Expos Recruiting Policies U Career Success 1731 E Campus Center Dr, STE 1300 SALT LAKE CITY, UT 84112 801-587-8687 Top Resources International Student Resources Other Campus Partners Contact Us © 2026 THE UNIVERSITY OF UTAH Nondiscrimination & Accessibility Disclaimer Privacy About the U Media Contacts"
