    "https://www.linkedin.com/company/ucareersuccess": {
      "title": "U Career Success",
      "description": "U Career Success | University of Utah | LinkedIn Agree & Join LinkedIn By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Skip to main content LinkedIn Top Content People Learning Jobs Games Sign in Join now U Career Success | University of Utah Higher Education Salt Lake City, Utah 1,791 followers Get the skills, experience, and connections that lead to lifelong career success. Follow Discover all 63 employees Report this company About us U Career Success serves all University of Utah students through every stage in their career journeys.\n\nUsing a high-touch, personalized approach, we connect students to the experiences that will lead to lifelong career success. We focus on the unique skills, needs, and goals of each student to maximize their career potential.\n\nBy forging strong partnerships with employers and organizations – from start-ups to Fortune 100 companies with local to global presence – we expand student access to a wide range of opportunities while simultaneously fulfilling the short- and long-term hiring needs of our partners.\n\nWe believe that empowered U of U students become the leaders of the future, positively impacting the lives of their families, organizations, communities, and the world. Website https://careers.utah.edu/ External link for U Career Success | University of Utah Industry Higher Education Company size 11-50 employees Headquarters Salt Lake City, Utah Type Educational Employees at U Career Success | University of Utah Jennifer Kumar, ICF, PCC, Career Coach LinkedIn Member LinkedIn Member LinkedIn Member LinkedIn Member LinkedIn Member View 63 employees at U Career Success | University of Utah Sign in Welcome back Email or phone Password Show Forgot password? Sign in or By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . New to LinkedIn? Join now or By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . See all employees Locations Primary Salt Lake City, Utah, US Get directions Updates U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 2w Report this post Looking for a role where you make a daily impact? Come join the career coaching team at U Career Success | University of Utah ! \n\nWe're looking for team members who are passionate about helping students as they explore career possibilities, build confidence, and achieve their goals. And because we support students in colleges all across the university, we're hiring folks from a wide range of industries, including human services, marketing, healthcare, engineering, business, sciences, and more!\n\nApply Here: https://buff.ly/5FsBAsm 56 1 Comment Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 3mo Report this post A few weeks ago we hosted the UACE Statewide New Grad and Alumni Career Fair, here at the University of Utah student union. \n\nCareer centers from across the state of Utah, over 80+ employers, and hundreds of students came together for this amazing event. \n\nWe’re grateful to all of our partners who helped make this day so successful and we’re excited see what’s next for our graduates! 🎓 #UACE #uofu #recentgrads #careersuccess …more 6 Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 3mo Report this post A few weeks ago we hosted the UACE Statewide New Grad and Alumni Career Fair, here at the University of Utah student union. \n\nCareer centers from across the state of Utah, over 80+ employers, and hundreds of students came together for this amazing event. \n\nWe’re grateful to all of our partners who helped make this day so successful and we’re excited see what’s next for our graduates! 🎓 #UACE #uofu #recentgrads #careersuccess …more 30 Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 3mo Edited Report this post We are excited to host so many incredible employers at the upcoming UACE Alumni and Recent Grad Career Fair! These employers are excited to connect and help alumni from across the state of Utah find their next opportunity. \n\nFor recent grads and alumni wanting to attend, register using the link below! https://lnkd.in/gYVy7iqu 19 1 Comment Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 3mo Report this post Meet the Corporate and Community Engagement Team 👋\n\nSay hello to Leslie, a relationship manager on our Corporate and Community Engagement team. \n\nLeslie collaborates closely with partners in the Healthcare, Science, & Life Sciences industries helping build meaningful relationships that connect employers to University of Utah Students. \n\nOutside of work Leslie enjoys collecting new and unique styles of Vans shoes. She also enjoys spending time with her grandchildren and she is always on the hunt for her next favorite yogurt flavor of the month. \n\nWe are so lucky to have Leslie on our team, thanks for everything you do to connect, engage, and make a difference! 💼💙\n\nMake sure to say \"hi\" in the comments. 86 19 Comments Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 4mo Report this post We hosted our third annual Career Impact Awards and fashion show on Thursday, April 16. ✨ \n\nThe show featured exciting runway collections styled from our Cintas Career Closet followed by an awards ceremony highlighting our incredible students, campus departments, and employer partners. Award categories and winners included: Canyon View Credit Union Internship of the Year: \n\nBailey Ventura, Community Cooperative Nature School\n\nKinsley Macurdy, Huntsman Cancer Institute\n\nKaren Carreno, Granite School District\n\nJesse Johnson, Ask an Alum\n\nNicole Salem, CHOICE Humanitarian\n\n\nCareer Mentor of the Year: Bethany Buck Eric Alta Alexandra Ponette-Gonzalez\n\n\nPartner of the Year: University of Utah - David Eccles School of Business Marketing Department University of Utah John and Marcia Price College of Engineering QUEST: Lauren Aimonette Liang Mary Anne Berzins Employer of the Year: Fidelity Investments State of Utah Lucid Software 2026 Career Impact Award: Cintas We are incredibly grateful to all of our partners for an amazing year and look forward to what we can accomplish next! +11 52 7 Comments Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 4mo Report this post Meet the Corporate and Community Engagement Team 👋\n\nSay hello to Heather, a relationship manager on our Corporate and Community Engagement team. \n\nHeather collaborates closely with partners in the Engineering, Energy, and Defense industries helping build meaningful relationships that connect employers to University of Utah Students. \n\nOutside of work Heather runs a monthly meal effort for people experiencing homelessness. She has also adopted two three-legged dogs, a one-eyed cat, and a puppy from a trash can that she wishes she would have named Oscar (the grouch). \n\nWe are so lucky to have Heather on our team, thanks for everything you do to connect, engage, and make a difference! 💼💙\n\nMake sure to say \"hi\" in the comments. 42 10 Comments Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 4mo Report this post U Career Success is hosting our third annual fashion show combined with our Career Impact Awards. This event will unite students, staff, faculty, campus departments, and employer partners!\n \nStudents from across campus have submitted nominees to highlight internship experiences and career mentors that have impacted their path to career success. \n \nOur Cintas Career Closet will be highlighted in an exciting runway show, showcasing outfit options for your first day on your next job or internship!\n\nJoin us this Thursday, April 16th, at the Epicenter, we can't wait to see you there ✨ https://lnkd.in/g3eNWZQY View C2PA information 44 7 Comments Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 5mo Report this post We invite you to participate in the 2026 New Grad & Alumni Statewide Career Fair, a premier recruiting event designed to connect employers with emerging and experienced talent from across Utah. 🎓️ \n\nHosted in partnership with the Utah Association of Colleges and Employers, this statewide event brings together a diverse talent pool of new graduates and alumni from:\n\n• Brigham Young University\n• Ensign College\n• Salt Lake Community College\n• Snow College\n• Southern Utah University\n• The University of Utah\n• Utah State University\n• Utah Tech University\n• Utah Valley University\n• Weber State University\n• Westminster University\n\nWe are especially excited to offer a Veterans Early Entry Meet & Greet from 2:30–3:00 PM, giving employers dedicated time to connect with veterans who are both recent graduates and experienced professionals.\n\nWe hope you will join us! Use the link below to register, today! ✨️ https://lnkd.in/gEazqcd9 52 5 Comments Like Comment Share U Career Success | University of Utah 1,791 followers 5mo Edited Report this post Meet the Corporate and Community Engagement Team 👋\n\nSay hello to Christy, a relationship manager on our Corporate and Community Engagement team. \n\nChristy collaborates closely with partners in the Technology industry helping build meaningful relationships that connect employers to University of Utah Students. \n\nOutside of work Christy loves to read and spend time with her Shih Tzu, Norman. \n\nWe are so fortunate to have Christy on our team, thanks for everything you do to connect, engage, and make a difference! 💼💙 66 16 Comments Like Comment Share Join now to see what you are missing Find people you know at U Career Success | University of Utah Browse recommended jobs for you View all updates, news, and articles Join now Similar pages University of Utah Office for Global Engagement Higher Education Salt Lake City, UT McCluskey Center For Violence Prevention Higher Education Salt Lake City, Utah Business Student Government (BSG) Higher Education Salt Lake City, Utah Goff Strategic Leadership Institute Higher Education Salt Lake City, UT University of Utah Health Hospitals and Health Care Salt Lake City, Utah American Marketing Association Non-profit Organizations Chicago, IL Intermountain Health Hospitals and Health Care Murray , UT The Brookings Institution Think Tanks Washington, DC Women in Investing at the University of Utah Sports Teams and Clubs Bellefonte Museum Education Administration Programs Bellefonte, Pennsylvania Show more similar pages Show fewer similar pages Browse jobs Nurse jobs 683,200 open jobs Human Resources Generalist jobs 20,704 open jobs Human Resources Business Partner jobs 19,788 open jobs Human Resources Specialist jobs 34,340 open jobs Coordinator jobs 545,033 open jobs Director jobs 1,220,357 open jobs Public Relations Specialist jobs 22,856 open jobs Art Director jobs 42,355 open jobs Digital Marketing Manager jobs 17,135 open jobs Scientist jobs 48,969 open jobs Designer jobs 65,273 open jobs Marketing Manager jobs 106,879 open jobs Engineer jobs 555,845 open jobs Show more jobs like this Show fewer jobs like this More searches More searches Product Marketing Specialist jobs Finance Intern jobs Marketing Specialist jobs Laboratory Researcher jobs Laboratory Supervisor jobs Laboratory Manager jobs Materials Scientist jobs Research And Development Scientist jobs Program Coordinator jobs Chemist jobs Researcher jobs Scientist jobs Project Manager jobs Communications Specialist jobs Course Manager jobs Education Manager jobs Experience Designer jobs LinkedIn © 2026 About Accessibility User Agreement Privacy Policy Your California Privacy Choices Cookie Policy Copyright Policy Brand Policy Guest Controls Community Guidelines العربية (Arabic) বাংলা (Bangla) Čeština (Czech) Dansk (Danish) Deutsch (German) Ελληνικά (Greek) English (English) Español (Spanish) فارسی (Persian) Suomi (Finnish) Français (French) हिंदी (Hindi) Magyar (Hungarian) Bahasa Indonesia (Indonesian) Italiano (Italian) עברית (Hebrew) 日本語 (Japanese) 한국어 (Korean) मराठी (Marathi) Bahasa Malaysia (Malay) Nederlands (Dutch) Norsk (Norwegian) ਪੰਜਾਬੀ (Punjabi) Polski (Polish) Português (Portuguese) Română (Romanian) Русский (Russian) Svenska (Swedish) తెలుగు (Telugu) ภาษาไทย (Thai) Tagalog (Tagalog) Türkçe (Turkish) Українська (Ukrainian) Tiếng Việt (Vietnamese) 简体中文 (Chinese (Simplified)) 正體中文 (Chinese (Traditional)) Language Agree & Join LinkedIn By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy . Sign in to see who you already know at U Career Success | University of Utah Email or phone Password Show Forgot password? Sign in Sign in with Email or New to LinkedIn? Join now By clicking Continue to join or sign in, you agree to LinkedIn’s User Agreement , Privacy Policy , and Cookie Policy ."
